-The highest completion risk was no longer another small registry surface; it was that the overlay series could not be safely replayed as a continuous chain from the rev0840 handoff. rev0850 recovers the missing rev0840-to-rev0841 seed patch and adds a guarded application harness so the eventual full canonical pass has an executable path instead of manual patch choreography.
